                                "sense_id": "6e01ee06-2865-3dd2-a9c4-cb3f3fa129f0",
                                "text": "With Tiny, it is good as a surprise strat. If another team doesn't realize where he fits into the whole lineup, then you can really throw the opposition off balance."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "47eb738c-72ec-4d31-a665-24a52a317136",
                                "sense_id": "6e01ee06-2865-3dd2-a9c4-cb3f3fa129f0",
                                "text": "Many of the strats for the Glitchless speedrun came from Distortion2, who is a widely known speedrunner who has broken records in games Elden Ring and Seikiro."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "db35bae7-e374-41d4-b890-f2f66d5b109a",
                                "sense_id": "6e01ee06-2865-3dd2-a9c4-cb3f3fa129f0",
                                "text": "Marvel Rivals’ upcoming Strategist, Invisible Woman, could be set to bring back this one infamous strat from Overwatch thanks to her powerful kit."
